nsparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-white/20 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-md\">Wellness</div></div></div><div class=\"relative flex min-h-[20rem] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-sage-dark/10 bg-cream px-6 py-8\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-28 w-28 rounded-full border border-sage-dark/10\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"mb-5 block font-serif text-4xl leading-none text-sage-dark/50\">“</span><p class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-[1.45] text-deep-teal\">A healthier you is a brighter world.</p><div class=\"mt-7 h-px w-8 bg-sage-dark/30\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-20 mt-5 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-deep-teal/70\"><span class=\"font-medium text-deep-teal\">01</span><span>/</span><span>03</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Show image 1\" aria-current=\"true\" class=\"h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 w-8 bg-deep-teal\"></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Show image 2\" aria-current=\"false\" class=\"h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 w-1.5 bg-deep-teal/20 hover:bg-deep-teal/40\"></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Show image 3\" aria-current=\"false\" class=\"h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 w-1.5 bg-deep-teal/20 hover:bg-deep-teal/40\"></button></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous image\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-deep-teal/10 bg-white/60 text-deep-teal transition-all hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:bg-sage\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\